  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">KOVA Athletic</h3><p>KOVA Athletic is an Australian activewear brand creating premium, flattering and functional pieces designed for training, movement and everyday wear.</p><p>Our collections combine sculpting fits, buttery-soft performance fabrics and minimal designs that look just as good outside the gym as they do during a workout.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We focus on quality, fit and thoughtful design — from no-front-seam leggings and sculpting shorts to supportive sports bras, flares and everyday essentials. Our activewear is designed to feel premium while performing through real training.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Join the KOVA Affiliate Program and receive your own personalised discount code and/or referral link. You'll earn commission on eligible sales you refer to KOVA, giving you the opportunity to earn from content you're already creating.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>We love authentic content. Training videos, gym fits, running, HYROX, Pilates, try-ons, styling videos, reviews, Reels, TikToks and everyday lifestyle content are all welcome.</p><p><strong>Creator opportunities:</strong><br>We're looking to build genuine, ongoing relationships with creators who align with KOVA. High-performing affiliates may also be considered for product gifting, new-release collaborations and future paid opportunities.</p></div>",
